@@ -46,3 +55,14 @@
 clients or executable-code fetch paths. Tool/archive acquisition remains an
 explicit build-host provisioning step using immutable versioned URLs and
 SHA-256 verification; build execution itself is offline.
+
+The audit uses an immutable, non-empty static scan contract over `App/`,
+`Sources/`, and `relay/` for Swift, Go, Objective-C/C/C++, and header source.
+Go `_test.go` files are explicitly excluded because they are test tooling, not
+application runtime inputs; `scripts/` is likewise outside the declared
+runtime roots. Foundation network loaders, ambiguous `Data(contentsOf:)`
+loads, process/shell execution, Go network/process/plugin imports and calls,
+download commands, and HTTP locators are rejected. The only source-level
+exception is an explicit `Data(contentsOf: URL(fileURLWithPath: ...))` local
+file read. Missing roots, empty/partial extensions, disabled exclusions, and a
+scan that finds no source files are audit failures.
