+download commands, and HTTP locators are rejected. The only source-level
+exception is an explicit `Data(contentsOf: URL(fileURLWithPath: ...))` local
+file read. Missing roots, empty/partial extensions, disabled exclusions, and a
+scan that finds no source files are audit failures.
